Package: rCoreGage
Title: Data Quality Check Framework for Clinical and Analytical Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CoreGage Team", email = "support@coregage.io",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A configuration-driven framework for running domain-level
    data quality checks and consolidating findings into structured Excel
    reports with role-based feedback routing. Supports trial-level and
    study-level checks across multiple data domains. Reports are routed
    to separate feedback channels (DM, MW, SDTM, ADAM) and reviewer
    responses are incorporated on re-run.
